/****** UP-List.mcc/UPA_List_Count ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_List_Count -- attribute of UP-List.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       LONG: rows (notifies)
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_List_Count - access ISG. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-List.mcc
*
******/

